\"把桌上那支共用的红笔也推进抽屉缝\"\n\nHmm, this is also a relationship/workspace fact, not an action. But it's stated as context for the action. I could fold it into the action fact: \"乔米把桌上那支共用的红笔推进抽屉缝\". Yes, let me do that.\n\n10. 乔米站在原处看了褚衡两秒\n    status: 已发生\n    evidence: \"乔米站在原处看了他两秒\"\n\n11. 乔米把桌上共用的红笔推进抽屉缝\n    status: 已发生\n    evidence: \"把桌上那支共用的红笔也推进抽屉缝\"\n\n12. 乔米转身离开\n    status: 已发生\n    evidence: \"转身走了\"\n\nLet me also think about the 工位夹 (workstation clip) - this implies they share a workstation or have adjacent workstations. \"两人中间那条一直共用的抽屉\" - the drawer between them. So they have workstations next to each other with a shared drawer between them. This is implicit context.\n\nOK let me also think about whether to record 乔米 and 褚衡's relationship facts:\n- They are colleagues/乔米 is 褚衡's assistant\n- They have adjacent workstations with a shared drawer\n- They shared a red pen\n\nI think the assistant relationship is implied by her statement and worth recording. Let me add:\n\n乔米此前是褚衡的助理\nstatus: 已发生 (the relationship existed; she's now ending it)\nevidence: \"我不再给你做助理\" - this is the presupposition\n\nHmm, but this is presupposed, not explicitly stated. The instruction says \"不得用常识、原著记忆或背景卡补出当前章节没有表达的事件\" but doesn't forbid using presuppositions. However, it says facts should be \"明确成立\" (clearly established). A presupposition that she was his assistant is established by her declaration.\n\nI'll include it as: \"乔米此前是褚衡的助理\" with status 已发生 and evidence \"我不再给你做助理\" (the declaration that she was).\n\nActually wait - 乔米's declaration \"我不再给你做助理\" presupposes she was doing the assistant work. Without that, the statement doesn't make sense. So the fact that she was his assistant is presupposed by the text. I'll include it.\n\nLet me also add the fact that they're coworkers (implied by the shared workspace and assistant relationship).\n\nActually, I want to be careful. Let me just include the most directly supported facts. The 助理 relationship is presupposed; I'll re